@@ -0,0 +1,2199 @@
+<?xml version="1.0" encoding="ISO-8859-1"?>
+<!-- *ActualQuotes* by Willowmound, ver. 4.20 (Beyond the Sword) -->
+<!-- Leader-specific diplomacy text based on actual quotes, complete or paraphrased. Some other minor changes. -->
+<!-- advc.005h: Renamed from "Civ4GameText_Diplomacy.xml".
+	 Texts for leaders introduced by the expansions are in separate files.
+	 Deleted all the keys that were as in Vanilla.
+	 Reverted British spelling in text not belonging to leaders affiliated with Britain.
+	 In-line comments are all from AdvCiv, but only the ones prefixed with
+	 "advc.005h" describe changes made by AdvCiv. Those changes include a
+	 couple of unique texts for declarations of war.
+	 Note that the Actual Quotes mod does not change any translations. -->
+<Civ4GameText xmlns="http://www.firaxis.com">
+	<!-- Replaces "numberless minions" with best unit -->
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_6</Tag>
+		<English>My [OUR_BEST_UNIT]s are marching, [CT_NAME]. It's war. ([OUR_NAME] declares war!)</English>
+		<French>Bient&#244;t, mes innombrables guerriers vous extermineront jusqu'au dernier ! ([OUR_NAME] vous d&#233;clare la guerre !)</French>
+		<German>Meine zahllosen Untertanen werden Euch vernichten! ([OUR_NAME] erkl&#228;rt Euch den Krieg!)</German>
+		<Italian>I miei innumerevoli seguaci vi stermineranno rapidamente! ([OUR_NAME] dichiara guerra!)</Italian>
+		<Spanish>&#161;Pronto mis incontables seguidores os destruir&#225;n a todos! (&#161;[OUR_NAME] os declara la guerra!)</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<!-- spelling -->
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_9</Tag>
+		<English>I suppose you realize this means war. ([OUR_NAME] declares war!)</English>
+		<French>Je suppose que vous r&#233;alisez que cela signifie la guerre ? ([OUR_NAME] vous d&#233;clare la guerre !)</French>
+		<German>Ich denke Ihr wisst, dass das Krieg bedeutet! ([OUR_NAME] erkl&#228;rt Euch den Krieg!)</German>
+		<Italian>Credo tu sappia che questo significa guerra. ([OUR_NAME] dichiara guerra!)</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Supongo que os dais cuenta de que esto significa la guerra. (&#161;[OUR_NAME] os declara la guerra!)</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<!-- Streamlined a bit -->
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_10</Tag>
+		<English>The mighty [OUR_EMPIRE] has had enough of your deceit. Now you pay! ([OUR_NAME] declares war!)</English>
+		<French>Le puissant [OUR_EMPIRE] ne peut plus supporter vos trahisons et vos tromperies ! Maintenant, il faut payer ! ([OUR_NAME] vous d&#233;clare la guerre !)</French>
+		<German>Das m&#228;chtige [OUR_EMPIRE:2] hat genug von Euren betr&#252;gerischen Machenschaften! Jetzt werdet Ihr daf&#252;r bezahlen! ([OUR_NAME] erkl&#228;rt Euch den Krieg!)</German>
+		<Italian>L'[OUR_EMPIRE] ne ha abbastanza della tua perfidia e dei tuoi tradimenti! Ora pagherai! ([OUR_NAME] dichiara guerra!)</Italian>
+		<Spanish>&#161;El poderoso [OUR_EMPIRE] ya ha soportado bastante vuestras traiciones y enga&#241;os! &#161;Lo vais a pagar! (&#161;[OUR_NAME] os declara la guerra!)</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<!-- advc.005h: Kind of based on #6 ("numberless minions").
+		 And I've kept the FIS translations from #6.
+		 ... On second thought, let's not add this. -->
+	<!--TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_11</Tag>
+		<English>Boo! My innumerable hosts are marching toward [CT_CIV_SHORT]. ([OUR_NAME] declares war!)</English>
+		<French>Bient&#244;t, mes innombrables guerriers vous extermineront jusqu'au dernier ! ([OUR_NAME] vous d&#233;clare la guerre !)</French>
+		<German>Buh! Meine zahllosen Heere sind auf dem Weg nach [CT_CIV_SHORT]. ([OUR_NAME] erkl&#228;rt Euch den Krieg!)</German>
+		<Italian>I miei innumerevoli seguaci vi stermineranno rapidamente! ([OUR_NAME] dichiara guerra!)</Italian>
+		<Spanish>&#161;Pronto mis incontables seguidores os destruir&#225;n a todos! (&#161;[OUR_NAME] os declara la guerra!)</Spanish>
+	</TEXT-->
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_FRANKLIN_ROOSEVELT_1</Tag>
+		<English>Greetings! I am [OUR_NAME] of the [OUR_EMPIRE]. Be sincere; be brief; be seated. I hope our peoples can live together in peace.</English>
+		<French>Salutations ! Je suis [OUR_NAME], je r&#232;gne sur l'[OUR_EMPIRE]. Je souhaite que nos deux grands peuples puissent vivre en paix.</French>
+		<German>Seid gegr&#252;&#223;t! Ich bin [OUR_NAME], Staatsoberhaupt des [OUR_EMPIRE:3]es. Ich hoffe, unsere gro&#223;artigen V&#246;lker werden in Frieden zusammenleben.</German>
+		<Italian>Saluti! Io sono [OUR_NAME] dell'[OUR_EMPIRE]. Spero che i nostri due grandi popoli possano vivere in pace.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Saludos. &#161;Soy [OUR_NAME], del [OUR_EMPIRE]! Espero que nuestros dos grandes pueblos puedan vivir en paz.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_FRANKLIN_ROOSEVELT_2</Tag>
+		<English>I am [OUR_NAME] of the [OUR_EMPIRE]. I hope this will be the first meeting of many, [CT_NAME]. If civilization is to survive, we must cultivate the science of human relationships -- the ability of all peoples, of all kinds, to live together in the same world at peace.</English>
+		<French>Salutations ! Je suis [OUR_NAME], je r&#232;gne sur l'[OUR_EMPIRE]. Je souhaite que nos deux grands peuples puissent vivre en paix.</French>
+		<German>Seid gegr&#252;&#223;t! Ich bin [OUR_NAME], Staatsoberhaupt des [OUR_EMPIRE:3]es. Ich hoffe, unsere gro&#223;artigen V&#246;lker werden in Frieden zusammenleben.</German>
+		<Italian>Saluti! Io sono [OUR_NAME] dell'[OUR_EMPIRE]. Spero che i nostri due grandi popoli possano vivere in pace.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Saludos. &#161;Soy [OUR_NAME], del [OUR_EMPIRE]! Espero que nuestros dos grandes pueblos puedan vivir en paz.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_FRANKLIN_ROOSEVELT_3</Tag>
+		<English>Well met! I am [OUR_NAME]. The point in history at which we stand is full of promise and danger. The world will either move forward toward unity and widely shared prosperity -- or it will move apart. Which shall it be, [CT_NAME]?</English>
+		<French>Salutations ! Je suis [OUR_NAME], je r&#232;gne sur l'[OUR_EMPIRE]. Je souhaite que nos deux grands peuples puissent vivre en paix.</French>
+		<German>Seid gegr&#252;&#223;t! Ich bin [OUR_NAME], Staatsoberhaupt des [OUR_EMPIRE:3]es. Ich hoffe, unsere gro&#223;artigen V&#246;lker werden in Frieden zusammenleben.</German>
+		<Italian>Saluti! Io sono [OUR_NAME] dell'[OUR_EMPIRE]. Spero che i nostri due grandi popoli possano vivere in pace.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Saludos. &#161;Soy [OUR_NAME], del [OUR_EMPIRE]! Espero que nuestros dos grandes pueblos puedan vivir en paz.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_WASHINGTON_1</Tag>
+		<English>Hello there! I am [OUR_NAME] of the [OUR_EMPIRE]. Associate yourself with men of good quality, [CT_NAME], if you esteem your own reputation. It is better be alone than in bad company.</English>
+		<French>Bienvenue, [CT_NAME] ! Je ne peux pas mentir : &#231;a me fait plaisir de vous rencontrer !</French>
+		<German>Willkommen, [CT_NAME]! Ich kann es nicht leugnen: Ich bin mehr als erfreut, Euch kennen zu lernen!</German>
+		<Italian>Ti do il benvenuto, [CT_NAME]! Non mentir&#242;, sono incredibilmente contento di vederti!</Italian>
+		<Spanish>&#161;Os doy la bienvenida, [CT_NAME]! No puedo mentiros, estoy encantad&#237;simo de conoceros.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_WASHINGTON_2</Tag>
+		<English>Welcome, [CT_NAME]. I am [OUR_NAME], the leader of [OUR_CIV_SHORT]. I have no other view than to promote the public good, and am unambitious of honors not founded in the approbation of my country.</English>
+		<French>Bienvenue, [CT_NAME] ! Je ne peux pas mentir : &#231;a me fait plaisir de vous rencontrer !</French>
+		<German>Willkommen, [CT_NAME]! Ich kann es nicht leugnen: Ich bin mehr als erfreut, Euch kennen zu lernen!</German>
+		<Italian>Ti do il benvenuto, [CT_NAME]! Non mentir&#242;, sono incredibilmente contento di vederti!</Italian>
+		<Spanish>&#161;Os doy la bienvenida, [CT_NAME]! No puedo mentiros, estoy encantad&#237;simo de conoceros.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_WASHINGTON_3</Tag>
+		<English>Good to meet you, [CT_NAME]. I'm [OUR_NAME]. Observe good faith and justice toward all nations. Cultivate peace and harmony with all. That's my advice. What do you say?</English>
+		<French>Bienvenue, [CT_NAME] ! Je ne peux pas mentir : &#231;a me fait plaisir de vous rencontrer !</French>
+		<German>Willkommen, [CT_NAME]! Ich kann es nicht leugnen: Ich bin mehr als erfreut, Euch kennen zu lernen!</German>
+		<Italian>Ti do il benvenuto, [CT_NAME]! Non mentir&#242;, sono incredibilmente contento di vederti!</Italian>
+		<Spanish>&#161;Os doy la bienvenida, [CT_NAME]! No puedo mentiros, estoy encantad&#237;simo de conoceros.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_SALADIN_1</Tag>
+		<English>Greetings, [CT_NAME]! It is an honour to meet you. May your merchants supply us with all the weaponry we need to bring about your downfall. Inshallah.</English>
+		<French>Mes hommages, [CT_NAME] ! C'est un honneur de vous rencontrer ! Puisse le ciel vous accorder un empire l&#233;g&#232;rement moins glorieux que le mien !</French>
+		<German>Seid gegr&#252;&#223;t, [CT_NAME]! Es ist mir eine Ehre, Eure Bekanntschaft zu machen! M&#246;gen die G&#246;tter Euch mit einem Reich segnen, das dem Ruhm und der Pracht des meinen nacheifert!</German>
+		<Italian>Saluti [CT_NAME]! &#200; un onore incontrarti! Possa il cielo donarti un impero appena inferiore al mio!</Italian>
+		<Spanish>&#161;Saludos, [CT_NAME]! Es un honor conoceros. Que los cielos os concedan un imperio casi tan glorioso como el m&#237;o.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<!-- advc.005h: Make this #2, i.e. preserve "let us each slaughter slaves". -->
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_MONTEZUMA_2</Tag>
+		<English>[CT_NAME]. I know you have been told much evil of me; believe only what you see with your eyes, for those who speak ill of me are my enemies, and some were my vassals and have rebelled against me at your coming and said those things to gain favour with you. Please, let us have peace!</English>
+		<French>C'est un plaisir de faire votre connaissance, [CT_NAME] ! Sacrifions tous deux cinq mille esclaves pour c&#233;l&#233;brer cette rencontre de bon augure.</French>
+		<German>Ich freue mich, Euch kennen zu lernen, [CT_NAME]! Lasst uns zur Feier dieses denkw&#252;rdigen Augenblicks je f&#252;nfzigtausend Sklaven opfern!</German>
+		<Italian>Piacere di incontrarti, [CT_NAME]! Per festeggiare questo momento propizio, dovremmo massacrare cinquantamila schiavi ciascuno.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Me alegro mucho de conoceros, [CT_NAME]. Sacrifiquemos cada uno a cincuenta mil esclavos para celebrar esta propicia ocasi&#243;n.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_QIN_SHI_HUANG_1</Tag>
+		<English>Greetings, honorable [CT_NAME]. I am Emperor, my descendants will be numerous. From the second generation to the ten thousandth, my line will not end.</English>
+		<French>Mes respects, honorable [CT_NAME]. Esp&#233;rons que la paix et l'amiti&#233; r&#233;gneront toujours entre l'[OUR_EMPIRE] et les [CT_CIV_SHORT]. Car c'est la seule chose qui peut emp&#234;cher votre extermination.</French>
+		<German>Seid gegr&#252;&#223;t, ehrw&#252;rdiges Staatsoberhaupt [CT_NAME]. Hoffen wir, dass f&#252;r alle Zeit Friede und Freundschaft zwischen dem [OUR_EMPIRE:3] und [CT_CIV_SHORT] herrschen wird - andernfalls steht Eure sofortige Vernichtung bevor!</German>
+		<Italian>Saluti, onorabile [CT_NAME]. Mi auguro che regni sempre la pace e l'armonia tra [CT_CIV_SHORT] e l'[OUR_EMPIRE]... In caso contrario, ti distruggeremo.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Saludos, honorable [CT_NAME]. Esperemos que siempre reine la paz entre el [OUR_EMPIRE] y [CT_CIV_SHORT], pues ella es lo &#250;nico que se interpone entre vosotros y la aniquilaci&#243;n total. </Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_CHINESE_LEADER_1</Tag>
+		<English>Greetings, [CT_NAME]. The heroic people of [OUR_CIV_SHORT] salute you! Remember: once all struggle is grasped, miracles are possible.</English>
+		<French>Bonjour, [CT_NAME]. C'est un plaisir de vous rencontrer. Tenez, je vous offre un exemplaire de mon petit livre rouge. Vous y apprendrez peut-&#234;tre quelque chose.</French>
+		<German>Seid gegr&#252;&#223;t, [CT_NAME]. Ich freue mich, Eure Bekanntschaft zu machen. Hier, nehmt diese Abschrift meines kleinen roten Leitfadens. Ihr k&#246;nntet noch etwas lernen!</German>
+		<Italian>Saluti, [CT_NAME]. &#200; un piacere incontrarti. Ecco una copia del mio piccolo libro rosso. Potresti imparare qualcosa.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Saludos, [CT_NAME]. Es un placer conoceros. Tomad un ejemplar de mi libro rojo. Puede que aprend&#225;is algo y todo.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_CHINESE_LEADER_2</Tag>
+		<English>Greetings, [CT_NAME]. I am [OUR_NAME]. People like me sound like a lot of big cannons. Don't let that bother you though. Shall we have peace?</English>
+		<French>Bonjour, [CT_NAME]. C'est un plaisir de vous rencontrer. Tenez, je vous offre un exemplaire de mon petit livre rouge. Vous y apprendrez peut-&#234;tre quelque chose.</French>
+		<German>Seid gegr&#252;&#223;t, [CT_NAME]. Ich freue mich, Eure Bekanntschaft zu machen. Hier, nehmt diese Abschrift meines kleinen roten Leitfadens. Ihr k&#246;nntet noch etwas lernen!</German>
+		<Italian>Saluti, [CT_NAME]. &#200; un piacere incontrarti. Ecco una copia del mio piccolo libro rosso. Potresti imparare qualcosa.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Saludos, [CT_NAME]. Es un placer conoceros. Tomad un ejemplar de mi libro rojo. Puede que aprend&#225;is algo y todo.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_CHINESE_LEADER_3</Tag>
+		<English>Welcome, [CT_NAME]. I am [OUR_NAME], leader of the [OUR_CIV_ADJ] people. The cardinal responsibility of leadership is to identify the dominant contradiction at each point of the historical process and to work out a central line to resolve it. How should the two of us resolve this meeting?</English>
+		<French>Bonjour, [CT_NAME]. C'est un plaisir de vous rencontrer. Tenez, je vous offre un exemplaire de mon petit livre rouge. Vous y apprendrez peut-&#234;tre quelque chose.</French>
+		<German>Seid gegr&#252;&#223;t, [CT_NAME]. Ich freue mich, Eure Bekanntschaft zu machen. Hier, nehmt diese Abschrift meines kleinen roten Leitfadens. Ihr k&#246;nntet noch etwas lernen!</German>
+		<Italian>Saluti, [CT_NAME]. &#200; un piacere incontrarti. Ecco una copia del mio piccolo libro rosso. Potresti imparare qualcosa.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Saludos, [CT_NAME]. Es un placer conoceros. Tomad un ejemplar de mi libro rojo. Puede que aprend&#225;is algo y todo.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_HATSHEPSUT_1</Tag>
+		<English>[CT_NAME]! I am the Horus, mighty by his Kas, the lord of East and West abounding in years, the good goddess, the pious lady, the golden falcon, the King of Upper and Lower [OUR_CIV_SHORT], Kamara, the daughter of Ra, Khnumit Amon, [OUR_NAME].</English>
+		<French>Les dieux sont avec vous, [CT_NAME], car ils vous ont fait venir jusqu'&#224; moi !</French>
+		<German>Ganz offensichtlich sind die G&#246;tter Euch gewogen, [CT_NAME] - denn sie haben Euch den Weg zu mir gewiesen!</German>
+		<Italian>Di certo gli dei ti sorridono, [CT_NAME], perch&#233; ti hanno indicato la strada che porta a me!</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Sin duda los dioses os sonr&#237;en, [CT_NAME], pues os han tra&#237;do hasta m&#237;.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_ELIZABETH_1</Tag>
+		<English>Welcome to my palace, [CT_NAME]. I am [OUR_NAME]. You should know that I have already joined myself in marriage to a husband, namely the kingdom of [OUR_CIV_SHORT].</English>
+		<French>Bienvenue dans mon palais, [CT_NAME]. Je suis [OUR_NAME], sage et resplendissante reine des puissants [OUR_CIV_SHORT]. Que la paix r&#232;gne entre nous, sinon vous mourrez.</French>
+		<German>Willkommen in meinem Palast, [CT_NAME]. Ich bin [OUR_NAME], das nicht nur weise, sondern auch h&#246;chst begehrenswerte Staatsberhaupt des m&#228;chtigen Volkes von [OUR_CIV_SHORT]. Wahrt den Frieden, sonst werden wir Euch vernichten!</German>
+		<Italian>Ti do il benvenuto nel mio palazzo, [CT_NAME]. Io sono [OUR_NAME], la giusta e saggia guida [OUR_CIV_SHORT]. Che regni la pace tra noi, altrimenti ti uccideremo.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Os doy la bienvenida a mi palacio, [CT_NAME]. Soy [OUR_NAME], la sabia y hermos&#237;sima l&#237;der de la poderosa [OUR_CIV_SHORT]. Que la paz reine entre nosotros, u os matar&#233;.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_ELIZABETH_2</Tag>
+		<English>[CT_NAME], I greet you. I am [OUR_NAME]. I may have the body of a weak and feeble woman, but I have the heart and stomach of a king, and a king of [OUR_CIV_SHORT] too!</English>
+		<French>Bienvenue dans mon palais, [CT_NAME]. Je suis [OUR_NAME], sage et resplendissante reine des puissants [OUR_CIV_SHORT]. Que la paix r&#232;gne entre nous, sinon vous mourrez.</French>
+		<German>Willkommen in meinem Palast, [CT_NAME]. Ich bin [OUR_NAME], das nicht nur weise, sondern auch h&#246;chst begehrenswerte Staatsberhaupt des m&#228;chtigen Volkes von [OUR_CIV_SHORT]. Wahrt den Frieden, sonst werden wir Euch vernichten!</German>
+		<Italian>Ti do il benvenuto nel mio palazzo, [CT_NAME]. Io sono [OUR_NAME], la giusta e saggia guida [OUR_CIV_SHORT]. Che regni la pace tra noi, altrimenti ti uccideremo.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Os doy la bienvenida a mi palacio, [CT_NAME]. Soy [OUR_NAME], la sabia y hermos&#237;sima l&#237;der de la poderosa [OUR_CIV_SHORT]. Que la paz reine entre nosotros, u os matar&#233;.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_ELIZABETH_3</Tag>
+		<English>I am [OUR_NAME] of the [OUR_CIV_ADJ]. I greet you, [CT_NAME], ruler of [CT_CIV_SHORT]. We princes are set, as it were, upon stages in the sight and view of the world. Let us behave civilly, and make peace.</English>
