+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_VICTORIA_1</Tag>
+		<English>Good day to you, [CT_NAME]. We are [OUR_NAME], ruler of [OUR_CIV_SHORT]. The important thing is not what you think of me, but what I think of you.</English>
+		<French>Je vous salue, [CT_NAME]. Nous sommes [OUR_NAME], reine des [OUR_CIV_SHORT]. N'h&#233;sitez pas &#224; nous appeler si vous avez besoin d'aide... Dieu ne nous demande-t-il pas d'aider et de r&#233;conforter ceux qui nous sont inf&#233;rieurs ?</French>
+		<German>Ich gr&#252;&#223;e Euch, [CT_NAME]. Ich bin [OUR_NAME], Staatsoberhaupt von [OUR_CIV_SHORT]. Z&#246;gert nicht, uns bei Bedarf um Unterst&#252;tzung zu bitten - es ist Gottes Wille, dass wir Minderbemittelten Trost und Hilfe spenden ...</German>
+		<Italian>Buongiorno a te, [CT_NAME]. Io sono [OUR_NAME], sovrana [OUR_CIV_SHORT]. Non esitare a contattarci se dovessi avere bisogno di aiuto, Dio dice di aiutare e confortare gli esseri a noi inferiori...</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Buenos d&#237;as teng&#225;is, [CT_NAME]. Soy [OUR_NAME], mandataria de [OUR_CIV_SHORT]. Por favor, no dud&#233;is en hacernos llamar si necesit&#225;is ayuda. Dios nos ordena auxiliar y reconfortar a nuestros inferiores...</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_VICTORIA_2</Tag>
+		<English>We are [OUR_NAME], sovereign of the [OUR_EMPIRE]. We would venture to warn against too great intimacy with artists, as it is very seductive and a little dangerous. You know what we mean, [CT_NAME]. Now, are we to have peace?</English>
