+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_NAPOLEON_3</Tag>
+		<English>The leader of the [CT_EMPIRE], it is good to meet you at last! I am [OUR_NAME], Marshal of [OUR_CIV_SHORT]. A leader is a dealer in hope, [CT_NAME], and history is a set of lies agreed upon. Let us have peace -- for now.</English>
+		<French>Salutations. Je suis [OUR_NAME], empereur, mar&#233;chal et premier citoyen des [OUR_CIV_SHORT]. Vous pourriez m'appeler "le petit caporal", mais je vous tuerais sur-le-champ.</French>
+		<German>Seid gegr&#252;&#223;t. Ich bin [OUR_NAME], Staatsoberhaupt von [OUR_CIV_SHORT]. Ihr d&#252;rft mich auch den "kleinen General" nennen, allerdings muss ich Euch dann t&#246;ten!</German>
+		<Italian>Salve. Io sono [OUR_NAME], Imperatore, Maresciallo e Primo Cittadino [OUR_CIV_SHORT:4]. Puoi chiamarmi "piccolo caporale", ma poi dovr&#242; ucciderti.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Saludos. Soy [OUR_NAME], emperador, mariscal y primer ciudadano de [OUR_CIV_SHORT]. Pod&#233;is llamarme "Peque&#241;o Caporal", pero entonces tendr&#237;a que mataros.</Spanish>
