+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_WASHINGTON_1</Tag>
+		<English>Be courteous to all, [CT_NAME], but intimate with few, and let those few be well tried before you give them your confidence! Now that I have given you mine, how may [OUR_CIV_SHORT] be of assistance?</English>
+		<French>Mes hommages, [CT_NAME]. Avez-vous fait bon voyage depuis le pays des [CT_CIV_SHORT] ? J'y ai s&#233;journ&#233; une fois, vous savez...</French>
+		<German>Seid gegr&#252;&#223;t, [CT_NAME]. Hattet Ihr eine angenehme Reise? Wusstet Ihr, dass ich mal in [CT_CIV_SHORT] gen&#228;chtigt habe?</German>
+		<Italian>Salve, [CT_NAME]. Come &#232; stato il tuo viaggio dalle terre [CT_CIV_SHORT:4]? Una volta ho dormito l&#224;.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Saludos, [CT_NAME]. &#191;Qu&#233; tal vuestro viaje desde [CT_CIV_SHORT]? Una vez dorm&#237; all&#237;, como ya sab&#233;is. </Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<!-- advc.005h: Restore the beginning of the Vanilla text -
+		 "abs. marvey" vs. "great" -->
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_FRANKLIN_ROOSEVELT_1</Tag>
+		<English>Absolutely marvey to see you, [CT_NAME]! I've always said human kindness never weakened the stamina or softened the fiber of a free people. A nation does not have to be cruel to be tough. So tell me, how may the [OUR_CIV_ADJ] people help?</English>
+		<French>Je suis positivement ravi de vous revoir, [CT_NAME] ! Prenez un si&#232;ge, mon domestique va vous servir un Martini.</French>
+		<German>Ich bin entz&#252;ckt, Euch wiederzusehen, [CT_NAME]! Nehmt Platz, ich lasse Euch einen Martini bringen.</German>
+		<Italian>&#200; una sorpresa eccezionale vederti di nuovo, [CT_NAME]! Siediti, ti far&#242; portare un Martini.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>&#161;Volver a veros es una aut&#233;ntica delicia, [CT_NAME]! Sentaos, mi criado os pondr&#225; un Martini.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<!-- advc.005h: Restore Vanilla #1 as #2 with a bit of variation
+		 at the start. -->
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_FRANKLIN_ROOSEVELT_2</Tag>
+		<English>How agreat to see you again, [CT_NAME]! Do sit down; my man will get you a Martini.</English>
+		<French>Je suis positivement ravi de vous revoir, [CT_NAME] ! Prenez un si&#232;ge, mon domestique va vous servir un Martini.</French>
+		<German>Ich bin entz&#252;ckt, Euch wiederzusehen, [CT_NAME]! Nehmt Platz, ich lasse Euch einen Martini bringen.</German>
+		<Italian>&#200; una sorpresa eccezionale vederti di nuovo, [CT_NAME]! Siediti, ti far&#242; portare un Martini.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>&#161;Volver a veros es una aut&#233;ntica delicia, [CT_NAME]! Sentaos, mi criado os pondr&#225; un Martini.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_SALADIN_1</Tag>
+		<English>Blessings be upon you, [CT_NAME]! I have returned to the native land a part that had been missing from it. Your ongoing trade and assistance is what made it possible.</English>
+		<French>Que le ciel vous b&#233;nisse, &#244; formidable [CT_NAME] ! Votre glorieuse pr&#233;sence est un grand honneur pour mon humble royaume !</French>
+		<German>Gesegnet seid Ihr, oh [NUM1:m&#228;chtiger:m&#228;chtige] [CT_NAME]! Es ist eine gro&#223;e Ehre f&#252;r unser bescheidenes K&#246;nigreich, eine solch ruhmreiche Pers&#246;nlichkeit wie Euch begr&#252;&#223;en zu d&#252;rfen!</German>
+		<Italian>Che Dio ti benedica, potente [CT_NAME]! &#200; un onore per il mio umile regno ospitare la tua grande persona!</Italian>
+		<Spanish>&#161;Mil bendiciones caigan sobre vos, omnipotente [CT_NAME]! &#161;La visita de alguien tan importante es un gran honor para mi humilde reino!</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_MONTEZUMA_1</Tag>
+		<English>My friend, I know that you have been told that the walls of my houses are made of gold, and that other things in my household are likewise of gold. The houses, as you can see, are of stone and lime and clay, but as long as you are here, consider these houses your own.</English>
+		<French>Bienvenue, [CT_NAME] ! Je vais massacrer mille esclaves pour c&#233;l&#233;brer votre visite !</French>
+		<German>Willkommen, [CT_NAME]! Ich werde Euch zu Ehren zahlreiche Sklaven niedermetzeln lassen!</German>
+		<Italian>Ti do il benvenuto, [CT_NAME]! Per onorare la tua visita, uccider&#242; un gran numero di schiavi!</Italian>
+		<Spanish>&#161;Os saludamos, amigable [CT_NAME]! &#161;Sacrificar&#233; a un sinf&#237;n de esclavos para conmemorar vuestra visita!</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_QIN_SHI_HUANG_1</Tag>
+		<English>Greetings to you, [CT_NAME]! I have worked day and night without rest; defined the laws, left nothing in doubt. Administration is smoothly carried out; all is done correctly, all according to plan. The [OUR_CIV_ADJ] people thank you for this time of peace and prosperity.</English>
+		<French>Salutations, [CT_NAME] ! Qui allons-nous trahir et d&#233;truire aujourd'hui ?</French>
+		<German>Seid gegr&#252;&#223;t, [CT_NAME]! Wen sollen wir denn heute mal verraten und vernichten?</German>
+		<Italian>Saluti, [CT_NAME]! Chi dobbiamo tradire e distruggere, oggi?</Italian>
+		<Spanish>&#161;Saludos, [CT_NAME]! &#191;A qui&#233;n debemos traicionar y destruir hoy?</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_CHINESE_LEADER_1</Tag>
+		<English>Let a hundred flowers bloom, let a hundred schools of thought contend! This is a good day. How may [OUR_CIV_SHORT] be of service?</English>
+		<French>Au nom du glorieux Parti Communiste de Chine et de tous ses paysans incultes... heu, de tous ses "glorieux travailleurs"... je vous salue !</French>
+		<German>Im Namen der gro&#223;en ruhmreichen kommunistischen Partei Chinas und all ihrer einfallslosen kleinen Anh&#228;nger - &#228;h, ich meine "ehrenhaften Arbeiter" - Willkommen!</German>
+		<Italian>Un messaggio di benvenuto da parte del grande e glorioso Partito Comunista della Cina e dai suoi orridi contadini... volevo dire, "grandi lavoratori"!</Italian>
+		<Spanish>El grande y glorioso Partido Comunista Chino y todos sus horribles campesinos de pacotilla -quiero decir, "gloriosos trabajadores"- os dan la bienvenida.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_HATSHEPSUT_1</Tag>
+		<English>Greetings to you, [CT_NAME]. To look upon me is to behold greater beauty than anything; my splendour and my form are divine; I am a maiden, beautiful and blooming. You are very welcome in my palace.</English>
+		<French>Bonjour, [CT_NAME]. C'est tout &#224; votre honneur de revenir me voir.</French>
+		<German>Abermals willkommen, [CT_NAME]. Ihr m&#252;sst Euch doch sehr geehrt f&#252;hlen, mich wiedersehen zu d&#252;rfen, oder?</German>
+		<Italian>Salve ancora, [CT_NAME]. Per te dev'essere un onore vedermi di nuovo...</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Saludos de nuevo, [CT_NAME]. Qu&#233; gran honor debe de ser para vos volver a vernos.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_ELIZABETH_1</Tag>
+		<English>Oh, [CT_NAME], it is good to see you again. You know, with your head and my purse I could do anything! Tell me, what is it that you need?</English>
+		<French>Bonjour, [CT_NAME]. Comment va votre petit empire d&#233;suet ?</French>
+		<German>Guten Tag, [CT_NAME]. Nun? Wie steht es um Euer altert&#252;mliches kleines Reich?</German>
+		<Italian>Buon pomeriggio, [CT_NAME]. Come ve la passate nel vostro piccolo, bizzarro impero?</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Buenos d&#237;as, [CT_NAME]. &#191;C&#243;mo le va a ese peque&#241;o y pintoresco imperio vuestro?</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_ELIZABETH_2</Tag>
+		<English>All my possessions for a moment of time! It is hard work being ruler. But to see you, my friend, makes me a little happier. What can I do for you?</English>
+		<French>Bonjour, [CT_NAME]. Comment va votre petit empire d&#233;suet ?</French>
+		<German>Guten Tag, [CT_NAME]. Nun? Wie steht es um Euer altert&#252;mliches kleines Reich?</German>
+		<Italian>Buon pomeriggio, [CT_NAME]. Come ve la passate nel vostro piccolo, bizzarro impero?</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Buenos d&#237;as, [CT_NAME]. &#191;C&#243;mo le va a ese peque&#241;o y pintoresco imperio vuestro?</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_VICTORIA_1</Tag>
+		<English>I hate politics and turmoil, [CT_NAME]. We women are not made for governing, and if we are good women, we must dislike these masculine occupations. There are times which force one to take interest in them, however, and I do of course intensely. Was there anything in particular you wished to discuss?</English>
+		<French>Au nom de la Grande-Bretagne, nous vous accordons une audience presque de bonne gr&#226;ce, [CT_NAME].</French>
+		<German>Ich freue mich, Euch im Namen des m&#228;chtigen Reiches von Britannien eine Audienz erweisen zu d&#252;rfen, [CT_NAME].</German>
+		<Italian>In nome della potente Britannia, siamo quasi lieti di offrirti un'occasione per parlare, [CT_NAME].</Italian>
+		<Spanish>De parte de la poderosa Breta&#241;a, estamos casi complacidos de concederos una audiencia, [CT_NAME].</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_LOUIS_XIV_1</Tag>
+		<English>Welcome to my palace, [CT_NAME]. Everything starts with the customer; how may I help?</English>
+		<French>Bienvenue dans mon palais, [CT_NAME]. Voulez-vous m'admirer pendant que je me rase ?</French>
+		<German>Willkommen in meinem bescheidenen Palast, [CT_NAME]. Wollt Ihr mir beim Rasieren zusehen?</German>
+		<Italian>Ti do il benvenuto nel mio palazzo, [CT_NAME]. Ti dispiace guardarmi mentre mi rado?</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Os doy la bienvenida a mi palacio, [CT_NAME]. &#191;Os importa si me afeito?</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_NAPOLEON_1</Tag>
+		<English>I have only one counsel for you, [CT_NAME] -- be master.</English>
+		<French>J'ai fort &#224; faire aujourd'hui, [CT_NAME], mais je peux vous accorder une br&#232;ve audience.</French>
+		<German>Ich habe heute viel zu tun, [CT_NAME], m&#246;glicherweise kann ich Euch aber dennoch eine kurze Audienz gew&#228;hren.</German>
+		<Italian>Oggi &#232; una giornata intensa, [CT_NAME], ma forse posso concederti una breve udienza.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Hoy estamos muy ocupados, [CT_NAME], pero quiz&#225; podamos concederos una breve audiencia.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_NAPOLEON_2</Tag>
+		<English>If you wish to be a success in the world, [CT_NAME], promise everything, deliver nothing. Now, let's get down to business.</English>
+		<French>J'ai fort &#224; faire aujourd'hui, [CT_NAME], mais je peux vous accorder une br&#232;ve audience.</French>
+		<German>Ich habe heute viel zu tun, [CT_NAME], m&#246;glicherweise kann ich Euch aber dennoch eine kurze Audienz gew&#228;hren.</German>
+		<Italian>Oggi &#232; una giornata intensa, [CT_NAME], ma forse posso concederti una breve udienza.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Hoy estamos muy ocupados, [CT_NAME], pero quiz&#225; podamos concederos una breve audiencia.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_BISMARCK_1</Tag>
+		<English>When you want to fool the world, tell the truth! What can I do for you today, [CT_NAME]?</English>
+		<French>Les [OUR_CIV_SHORT] vous saluent, [CT_NAME]. Venez... asseyez-vous et admirez mes immenses moustaches !</French>
+		<German>Das Volk von [OUR_CIV_SHORT] gr&#252;&#223;t Euch, [CT_NAME]. Kommt - nehmt Platz und bewundert meine umfassende Bart- und Per&#252;ckensammlung!</German>
+		<Italian>[OUR_CIV_SHORT:1] ti saluta, [CT_NAME]. Vieni, siediti qui e ammira i miei enormi baffi!</Italian>
+		<Spanish>[OUR_CIV_SHORT] os saluda, [CT_NAME]. &#161;Venga, sentaos y admirad mi impresionante mostacho!</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_BISMARCK_2</Tag>
+		<English>A statesman must wait until he hears the steps of God sounding through events, then leap up and grasp the hem of His garment! Do you hear what I hear, [CT_NAME]? I have a good feeling about this meeting.</English>
+		<French>Les [OUR_CIV_SHORT] vous saluent, [CT_NAME]. Venez... asseyez-vous et admirez mes immenses moustaches !</French>
+		<German>Das Volk von [OUR_CIV_SHORT] gr&#252;&#223;t Euch, [CT_NAME]. Kommt - nehmt Platz und bewundert meine umfassende Bart- und Per&#252;ckensammlung!</German>
+		<Italian>[OUR_CIV_SHORT:1] ti saluta, [CT_NAME]. Vieni, siediti qui e ammira i miei enormi baffi!</Italian>
+		<Spanish>[OUR_CIV_SHORT] os saluda, [CT_NAME]. &#161;Venga, sentaos y admirad mi impresionante mostacho!</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_FREDERICK_1</Tag>
+		<English>My people and I have come to an agreement that satisfied us both. They are to say what they please, and I am to do what I please. And it pleases me to see you!</English>
+		<French>Les [OUR_CIV_SHORT] vous saluent, [CT_NAME]. Venez... asseyez-vous et admirez mes immenses moustaches !</French>
+		<German>Das Volk von [OUR_CIV_SHORT] gr&#252;&#223;t Euch, [CT_NAME]. Kommt - nehmt Platz und bewundert meine umfassende Bart- und Per&#252;ckensammlung!</German>
+		<Italian>[OUR_CIV_SHORT:1] ti saluta, [CT_NAME]. Vieni, siediti qui e ammira i miei enormi baffi!</Italian>
+		<Spanish>[OUR_CIV_SHORT] os saluda, [CT_NAME]. &#161;Venga, sentaos y admirad mi impresionante mostacho!</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_ALEXANDER_1</Tag>
+		<English>In faith and hope the world will disagree, but all mankind's concern is charity. Greetings my friend, let us make trade!</English>
+		<French>Je vous souhaite la bienvenue ! Venez, allons d&#233;truire nos ennemis du haut de nos chars et laissons cinquante mille cadavres sur le champ de bataille pour le festin des corbeaux !</French>
+		<German>Willkommen! Lasst uns unsere Streitwagen anspannen und unsere Feinde vernichten! M&#246;gen die Gefallenen auf dem Schlachtfeld ein Festmahl f&#252;r die Geier sein!</German>
+		<Italian>Salve, ti do il benvenuto! Montiamo sulle bighe e distruggiamo i nemici, lasceremo sul campo di battaglia solamente i cadaveri perch&#233; se ne sfamino i corvi!</Italian>
+		<Spanish>&#161;Os saludamos, camarada! Venga, montemos en los carros, destruyamos a nuestros enemigos y dejemos cincuenta mil cad&#225;veres pudri&#233;ndose en el campo de batalla como pasto para los cuervos.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_ALEXANDER_2</Tag>
+		<English>It's good to see you again, [CT_NAME]. I'm telling you, I'm dying from the treatment of too many physicians. Everyone fusses over me in [OUR_CIV_SHORT]. So, how are things in [CT_CIV_SHORT]?</English>
+		<French>Je vous souhaite la bienvenue ! Venez, allons d&#233;truire nos ennemis du haut de nos chars et laissons cinquante mille cadavres sur le champ de bataille pour le festin des corbeaux !</French>
+		<German>Willkommen! Lasst uns unsere Streitwagen anspannen und unsere Feinde vernichten! M&#246;gen die Gefallenen auf dem Schlachtfeld ein Festmahl f&#252;r die Geier sein!</German>
+		<Italian>Salve, ti do il benvenuto! Montiamo sulle bighe e distruggiamo i nemici, lasceremo sul campo di battaglia solamente i cadaveri perch&#233; se ne sfamino i corvi!</Italian>
+		<Spanish>&#161;Os saludamos, camarada! Venga, montemos en los carros, destruyamos a nuestros enemigos y dejemos cincuenta mil cad&#225;veres pudri&#233;ndose en el campo de batalla como pasto para los cuervos.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_ASOKA_1</Tag>
