+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_TOKUGAWA_1</Tag>
+		<English>It is good to see you again, [CT_NAME]. Let thy step be slow and steady, that thou stumble not.</English>
