+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_CHINESE_LEADER_1</Tag>
+		<English>Swollen in head, weak in legs, sharp in tongue but empty in belly. Needless to say, I haven't missed you.</English>
