+		<Spanish>&#161;Que los cielos bendigan y santifiquen la amistad que une a nuestros dos grandes pueblos!</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<!-- spelling -->
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_THANKS_40</Tag>
+		<English>Thank you, [CT_NAME]. May both our peoples profit from our continued friendship.</English>
+		<French>Merci, [CT_NAME]. J'esp&#232;re que nos deux peuples profiteront de notre longue amiti&#233; !</French>
+		<German>Danke, [CT_NAME]. M&#246;gen unsere V&#246;lker von unseren fortgesetzten freundschaftlichen Beziehungen profitieren!</German>
+		<Italian>Grazie, [CT_NAME]. Che le nostre genti godano della nostra rinnovata amicizia! </Italian>
+		<Spanish>Gracias, [CT_NAME]. &#161;Que nuestros pueblos se beneficien de nuestra amistad duradera!</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<!-- Original said "whatever your culture's name is" -->
