+	</TEXT>
+	<!-- omits "for your visit" -->
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_THANKS_56</Tag>
+		<English>You are almost an equal in cunning and martial prowess, [CT_NAME]. I, [OUR_NAME], thank you.</English>
+		<French>Vos prouesses et votre habilet&#233; sont &#233;gales aux miennes, [CT_NAME]. Moi, [OUR_NAME], je vous remercie de votre visite.</French>
+		<German>Ihr seid uns in punkto Gerissenheit und milit&#228;rischer St&#228;rke nahezu ebenb&#252;rtig, [CT_NAME]. Ich, [OUR_NAME], danke Euch f&#252;r Euren Besuch.</German>
+		<Italian>Siete quasi alla nostra altezza in fatto di astuzia e valore, [CT_NAME]. Io, [OUR_NAME], ti ringrazio per averci fatto visita.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Sois casi igual a nos en astucia y habilidad militar, [CT_NAME]. Nos, [OUR_NAME], os agradecemos vuestra visita.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<!-- Original said "come back again" -->
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_THANKS_68</Tag>
+		<English>It appears that this visit was not a complete waste. Come see me when you have something else to offer the [OUR_EMPIRE].</English>
+		<French>Finalement, votre visite n'aura pas &#233;t&#233; totalement inutile. Revenez quand vous aurez autre chose &#224; offrir &#224; l'[OUR_EMPIRE].</French>
+		<German>Wie es scheint, hat sich Euer Besuch doch noch gelohnt. Ihr seid jederzeit willkommen, wenn Ihr dem [OUR_EMPIRE:3] wieder mal etwas anzubieten habt.</German>
+		<Italian>Pare che la tua visita non sia stata una completa perdita di tempo. Torna quando avrai qualcos'altro da offrire all'[OUR_EMPIRE].</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Parece que vuestra visita no ha sido una completa p&#233;rdida de tiempo. Volved cuando teng&#225;is algo m&#225;s que ofrecer al [OUR_EMPIRE].</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<!-- advc.005h: Originally says "... little culture". That's OK with me. -->
