-	</TEXT>
-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_FRANKLIN_ROOSEVELT_3</Tag>
-		<English>Well met! I am [OUR_NAME]. The point in history at which we stand is full of promise and danger. The world will either move forward toward unity and widely shared prosperity -- or it will move apart. Which shall it be, [CT_NAME]?</English>
