-	</TEXT>
-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_WASHINGTON_1</Tag>
-		<English>Hello there! I am [OUR_NAME] of the [OUR_EMPIRE]. Associate yourself with men of good quality, [CT_NAME], if you esteem your own reputation. It is better be alone than in bad company.</English>
