-	</TEXT>
-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_WASHINGTON_2</Tag>
-		<English>Welcome, [CT_NAME]. I am [OUR_NAME], the leader of [OUR_CIV_SHORT]. I have no other view than to promote the public good, and am unambitious of honours not founded in the approbation of my country.</English>
