-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_SALADIN_1</Tag>
-		<English>Greetings, [CT_NAME]! It is an honour to meet you. May your merchants supply us with all the weaponry we need to bring about your downfall. Inshallah.</English>
