-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_MONTEZUMA_1</Tag>
-		<English>[CT_NAME]. I know you have been told much evil of me; believe only what you see with your eyes, for those who speak ill of me are my enemies, and some were my vassals and have rebelled against me at your coming and said those things to gain favour with you. Please, let us have peace!</English>
-		<French>C'est un plaisir de faire votre connaissance, [CT_NAME] ! Sacrifions tous deux cinq mille esclaves pour c&#233;l&#233;brer cette rencontre de bon augure.</French>
-		<German>Ich freue mich, Euch kennen zu lernen, [CT_NAME]! Lasst uns zur Feier dieses denkw&#252;rdigen Augenblicks je f&#252;nfzigtausend Sklaven opfern!</German>
-		<Italian>Piacere di incontrarti, [CT_NAME]! Per festeggiare questo momento propizio, dovremmo massacrare cinquantamila schiavi ciascuno.</Italian>
-		<Spanish>Me alegro mucho de conoceros, [CT_NAME]. Sacrifiquemos cada uno a cincuenta mil esclavos para celebrar esta propicia ocasi&#243;n.</Spanish>
