-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_ASOKA_1</Tag>
-		<English>The greatest progress of righteousness among men comes from the exhortation in favor of non-injury to life and abstention from killing living beings. Come back when you have realised this, [CT_NAME].</English>
