-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_TOKUGAWA_1</Tag>
-		<English>Forbearance is the root of quietness and assurance forever -- your behaviour, on the other hand, shall soon lead to your complete annihilation!</English>
