-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_WASHINGTON_1</Tag>
-		<English>Let your heart feel for the afflictions and distress of everyone, [CT_NAME], and let your hand give in proportion to your purse. This seems about right.</English>
