-		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_MONTEZUMA_1</Tag>
-		<English>Your deputy [OUR_NAME] has come to you, [CT_NAME]. I ask of you these presents with which to welcome me to your home.</English>
