-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_HATSHEPSUT_1</Tag>
-		<English>I come before you, [CT_NAME], with a humble request. My heart turns this way and that, as I think what the people will say; those who shall see my monuments in years to come and who shall speak of what I have done. I fear I have not done enough! If you help me now, you help the people of [OUR_CIV_SHORT].</English>
-		<French>J'allais vous demander de sacrifier mille guerriers &#224; ma grandeur, [CT_NAME], mais vous pouvez me donner ceci si vous pr&#233;f&#233;rez.</French>
-		<German>Eigentlich wollte ich Euch auffordern, mir zu Ehren 1.000 Krieger zu opfern, [CT_NAME], aber wenn es Euch lieber ist, k&#246;nnt Ihr auch diese Alternative w&#228;hlen.</German>
-		<Italian>Stavo per chiederti di sacrificare 1.000 guerrieri per onorare la mia grandezza, [CT_NAME], ma se preferisci puoi darmi questo.</Italian>
