-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_ELIZABETH_1</Tag>
-		<English>I shall desire you, my lord, to be assistant to me that I, with my ruling, and you with your service, may make a good account to Almighty God and leave some comfort to our posterity on earth.</English>
-		<French>Ne pensez-vous pas que c'est gr&#226;ce &#224; notre amiti&#233; qu'il fait bon vivre dans ce monde, [CT_NAME] ? C'est un bien modeste prix &#224; payer pour qu'elle dure encore...</French>
-		<German>Die freundschaftliche Verbundenheit unserer V&#246;lker macht diese Welt lebenswerter, [CT_NAME], findet Ihr nicht auch? Dieser Preis ist zweifellos nicht zu hoch, um sicherzustellen, dass das auch so bleibt ...</German>
-		<Italian>Il mondo &#232; un posto migliore grazie all'amicizia con te, [CT_NAME], non sei d'accordo? Non &#232; certo un prezzo troppo alto da pagare perch&#233; questa continui...</Italian>
-		<Spanish>El mundo es un lugar mejor gracias a nuestra amistad, [CT_NAME]. &#191;No os lo parece? Seguro que &#233;ste no es un precio demasiado alto para aseguraros de que siga siendo as&#237;...</Spanish>
-	</TEXT>
-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_VICTORIA_1</Tag>
-		<English>You know, [CT_NAME], I am every day more convinced that we women, if we are to be good women, feminine and domestic, are not fitted to reign. As it is, we do, and I am now compelled to ask of you this.</English>
