-		<English>Riches do not consist in the possession of treasures, [CT_NAME], but in the use made of them. Give these to us, and you will be rich indeed!</English>
-		<French>Mes arm&#233;es veulent conqu&#233;rir de nouvelles terres, [CT_NAME]. Faites en sorte que ce ne soient pas les v&#244;tres.</French>
