-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_BISMARCK_1</Tag>
-		<English>Guten Tag, [CT_NAME]. I have always said, better pointed bullets than pointed speeches. Today I will make an exception, however, and make an appeal to the goodness of your heart.</English>
-		<French>Pour la sauvegarde d'une amiti&#233; durable, je vous demande de verser un tribut au grand peuple de [OUR_NAME].</French>
