-		<Spanish>&#191;Un regalo para nos? &#161;Caramba, es justo lo que quer&#237;amos! &#191;C&#243;mo lo hab&#233;is adivinado?</Spanish>
-	</TEXT>
-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_ISABELLA_1</Tag>
-		<English>Heaven is on our side, [CT_NAME]. I pray that you know what's good for you.</English>
