-	</TEXT>
-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_WASHINGTON_1</Tag>
-		<English>Worry is the interest paid by those who borrow trouble, [CT_NAME]. Do yourself a favour and give us this.</English>
-		<French>Je ne vous mentirai pas, [CT_NAME] : nous voulons ce que vous avez, et d&#232;s que possible.</French>
-		<German>Ich will gar nicht lange drumrumreden, [CT_NAME]: Wir wollen etwas, was Ihr besitzt! Also lasst es uns doch bitte so bald wie m&#246;glich zukommen!</German>
-		<Italian>Non mentir&#242;, [CT_NAME]: vogliamo la tua roba. Daccela gentilmente, ti conviene...</Italian>
-		<Spanish>No os mentiremos, [CT_NAME], queremos algo de vosotros. D&#225;dnoslo gentilmente en cuanto os sea posible.</Spanish>
-	</TEXT>
-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_SALADIN_1</Tag>
-		<English>By the glory of God, I, [OUR_NAME], mightiest of his servants, do request a small donation from you, [CT_NAME]. You would be wise to consider my request carefully.</English>
-		<French>Pour la gloire du divin, moi, [OUR_NAME], le plus puissant de tous ses serviteurs, je vous demande un modeste tribut, [CT_NAME]. Il serait sage de bien r&#233;fl&#233;chir &#224; ma requ&#234;te.</French>
-		<German>Bei der Herrlichkeit Gottes: Ich, [OUR_NAME], als sein m&#228;chtigster Untertan, bitte Euch um eine kleine Spende, [CT_NAME]. Wenn Ihr klug seid, denkt Ihr sorgf&#228;ltig dar&#252;ber nach!</German>
-		<Italian>In nome di Dio, io, [OUR_NAME], il pi&#249; grande dei suoi servi, ti faccio richiesta di una piccola donazione, [CT_NAME]. Considerala attentamente e prendi una decisione saggia.</Italian>
-		<Spanish>Por la gloria de Al&#225;, nos, [OUR_NAME], el m&#225;s poderoso de sus servidores, os solicitamos una peque&#241;a donaci&#243;n, [CT_NAME]. Os conviene considerar detenidamente mi petici&#243;n.</Spanish>
-	</TEXT>
-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_MONTEZUMA_1</Tag>
-		<English>I pray to our Gods that you will not make me send my warriors into your house. They would cast you out of it and overthrow your rule. When you tried to recover what you had lost, it would be too late.</English>
-		<French>L'[OUR_EMPIRE] vous demande un modeste pr&#233;sent, [CT_NAME]. Mais si vous pr&#233;f&#233;rez, nous pouvons nous battre jusqu'&#224; la mort.</French>
-		<German>Das [OUR_EMPIRE:2] fordert eine kleine Spende von Euch, [CT_NAME]. Wenn es Euch lieber ist, k&#246;nnen wir aber auch so lange gegeneinander k&#228;mpfen, bis nur noch einer von uns &#252;brig ist!</German>
-		<Italian>L'[OUR_EMPIRE] ti richiede una piccola donazione, [CT_NAME]. Altrimenti, se preferisci, combatteremo finch&#233; una delle due nazioni non sar&#224; distrutta.</Italian>
-		<Spanish>El [OUR_EMPIRE] os pide una peque&#241;a donaci&#243;n, [CT_NAME]. O, si lo prefer&#237;s, podemos combatir hasta que una de las dos naciones quede destruida. </Spanish>
-	</TEXT>
-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_CHINESE_LEADER_1</Tag>
-		<English>Politics is war without bloodshed, while war is politics with bloodshed. Which type of politics do you prefer?</English>
-		<French>Voulez-vous participer &#224; notre programme de partage des richesses, [CT_NAME] ?</French>
