-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>TXT_KEY_EVENT_TRIGGER_HORSE_WHISPERING_DONE_1</Tag>
-		<English>Congratulations! You have met the goals of your horse trainers and built for them enough facilities to empower their plans. Please choose a reward from among the benefits your horse trainers are able to provide to you.</English>
