-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>TXT_KEY_EVENT_HARBORMASTER_HELP</Tag>
-		<English>[PARAGRAPH:1]To complete this quest, you must construct %d1 [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Harbors[COLOR_REVERT] in your various coastal cities. You will also have to build %d2 [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Caravels[COLOR_REVERT].[PARAGRAPH:1]You will fail this quest if a rival civilization completes it first, or if you reach the Industrial Era without having met the conditions.</English>
