-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>TXT_KEY_EVENT_CLASSIC_LITERATURE_DONE_2</Tag>
-		<English>Discover and decipher lost knowledge from within some of the literature.</English>
-		<French>D&#233;couvrir et d&#233;crypter les connaissances perdues &#224; l'aide de la litt&#233;rature.</French>
