-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>TXT_KEY_EVENT_CLASSIC_LITERATURE_DONE_HELP_2</Tag>
-		<English>[ICON_BULLET]Receive a random Technology from among Ancient Era techs not yet discovered.</English>
-		<French>[ICON_BULLET]Recevez une technologie al&#233;atoire parmi les technologies perdues de l'Ere Ancienne.</French>
