-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>TXT_KEY_EVENT_TRIGGER_FRIENDLY_LOCALS_1</Tag>
-		<English>A small tribe of friendly locals have granted sanctuary to our beleaguered %s3_unit.</English>
-		<French>Une petite tribu amicale a fourni un refuge &#224; notre unit&#233; : %s3_unit assi&#233;g&#233;e.</French>
