-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>TXT_KEY_EVENT_SLAVE_REVOLT_WARNING</Tag>
-		<English>Sir, our slaves are on the verge of revolting! As long as our society continues to use slaves, there is a possibility of them revolting!</English>
